  "definition": "Network Infrastructure comprises the physical and logical communication systems \u2014 fibre, wireless, routing, and switching equipment, alongside software-defined networking layers \u2014 that enable data transmission for real-time collaboration and distributed computing. Modern network infrastructure integrates 5G/6G wireless, SD-WAN, content delivery networks, and multi-access edge computing to support low-latency, high-bandwidth applications such as immersive XR experiences and autonomous systems.",
